  "slug": "time-off-incident-report-form",
  "title": "Time Off Incident Report Form",
  "subtitle": "Use this incident report to stabilize the event, preserve facts and evidence, analyze contributing factors, assign corrective work, and verify closeout for a time off workflow.",
  "description": "An original operational time off incident report form that controls a absence request and leave-administration record from identity and routing through evidence, qualified decision, exception management, implementation, handoff, and final verification.",
  "use_case": "Use when the employee, manager, scheduler, or leave administrator needs a traceable incident report so the qualified HR, leave, payroll, or policy reviewer can approve, conditionally approve, deny, pend, recode, extend, or route the requested absence under the current leave policy, scheduling rules, payroll controls, confidentiality requirements, and applicable leave obligations without relying on an informal email, spreadsheet, or unreviewed narrative.",
  "risk_tier": "C",
